{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a renowned \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u00a0\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 tasked with solving a case involving \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 events surrounding one of the \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 corporations. At first glance, the case seems routine: missing \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, strange \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, and unsettling \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 among employees. However, the deeper you dive into this enigma, the clearer it becomes that much more is at stake than \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/066929dc8224a902e9a1dc70846383f1.poster.avif?t=1750886001\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/066929dc8224a902e9a1dc70846383f1.webm?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/066929dc8224a902e9a1dc70846383f1.mp4?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Reporting System</strong><br>Every action, discovery, and solved puzzle must be documented in reports you submit to your client. The thoroughness of your reports affects the game's progression, unlocking or concealing critical storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/c2710103f0baf2c663b93354a24a5d9f.poster.avif?t=1750886001\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/c2710103f0baf2c663b93354a24a5d9f.webm?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/c2710103f0baf2c663b93354a24a5d9f.mp4?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Hidden Object Searches</strong><br>Find hidden clues in unexpected places\u2014from archives and laboratories to secret rooms. Every discovered item has significance, whether it\u2019s a broken cup, a mysterious letter, or an unusual flash drive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles That Shape the Outcome</strong><br>Each puzzle is more than just a challenge; it\u2019s part of a bigger picture. Decode ciphers, crack safes, and restore damaged documents to uncover more information and unravel the mystery further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/0f83ef3901bceb0c11e89feaaddfee1d.poster.avif?t=1750886001\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/0f83ef3901bceb0c11e89feaaddfee1d.webm?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/0f83ef3901bceb0c11e89feaaddfee1d.mp4?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Dialogue Choices</strong><br>Engage in conversations where your choices matter. Extract critical information, build trust, or manipulate suspects to advance your investigation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Environments</strong><br>Explore richly detailed settings that evolve with the story. From high-tech offices to abandoned facilities, each location hides secrets waiting to be uncovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong><br>Your decisions throughout the game determine the fate of the case, the corporation, and your reputation as an investigator. Choose wisely to unveil the truth or leave questions unanswered.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823280?t=1750886001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/537b766d483a6693c2ea8379985b07536127037e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750886001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/288b48b3a920ba86a8d828d9a6ba61a482d75f48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750886001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/288b48b3a920ba86a8d828d9a6ba61a482d75f48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750886001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Strong Language\r\nViolence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a renowned \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u00a0\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 tasked with solving a case involving \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 events surrounding one of the \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 corporations. At first glance, the case seems routine: missing \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, strange \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588, and unsettling \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 among employees. However, the deeper you dive into this enigma, the clearer it becomes that much more is at stake than \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u00a0secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/066929dc8224a902e9a1dc70846383f1.poster.avif?t=1750886001\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/066929dc8224a902e9a1dc70846383f1.webm?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/066929dc8224a902e9a1dc70846383f1.mp4?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Reporting System</strong><br>Every action, discovery, and solved puzzle must be documented in reports you submit to your client. The thoroughness of your reports affects the game's progression, unlocking or concealing critical storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/c2710103f0baf2c663b93354a24a5d9f.poster.avif?t=1750886001\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/c2710103f0baf2c663b93354a24a5d9f.webm?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823280/extras/c2710103f0baf2c663b93354a24a5d9f.mp4?t=1750886001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"